摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"⌨️ Keyboard shortcuts for the DSH chat composer — ↑↓ cycle history, Ctrl+C clear input. DSH web plugin.","id":"gh:1339128495","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-composer-keys","slug":"kexin8/dsh-composer-keys","topics":["chat","composer","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","keyboard-shortcuts","productivity"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"⌨️ Keyboard shortcuts for the DSH chat composer — ↑↓ cycle history, Ctrl+C clear input. DSH web plug"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"Keyboard shortcuts for the DSH chat composer — ↑↓ cycle history, Ctrl+C clear input. DSH web plugin."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-composer-keys ⌨️"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Keyboard shortcuts for the DeepSeek Harness (DSH) Web chat composer."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**中文文档：简体中文**"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Type faster, navigate history with pure keyboard. No mouse needed."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## ✨ Features"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"| Shortcut | Action |"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| **↑** Arrow Up | Fill the composer with the previous user message from history |\n| **↓** Arrow Dow"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"n | Move to the next user message; at the end, restore your original input |\n| **Ctrl+C** | Clear th"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"e composer when no text is selected (avoids conflict with Copy) |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"### Behavior details"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- **History cycling** follows shell-style semantics: press ↑ to walk backwards through\nyour previous"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"ly sent messages; press ↓ to walk forward again; at the newest end it\nrestores whatever you had type"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"d before you started navigating.\n- **Ctrl+C** only clears when the composer has content and no text "},{"id":"p10s4","text":"is selected —\nif you have selected text, the browser's native Copy takes precedence.\n- Uses **Ctrl+C"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"** only, identical on Windows and macOS (on macOS, `Cmd+C` stays the system Copy)."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## 📦 Install"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### From GitHub"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### From a local checkout"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"### Via npm (when published)"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"After installing, restart the DSH Web GUI and reload the page."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## 🧩 How it works"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"A client-only plugin. It registers an invisible component in the\n`conversation.composer.dock` slot ("},{"id":"p20s2","text":"the additive, non-destructive input-region seat),\nwhich attaches a `keydown` listener on `document` "},{"id":"p20s3","text":"and intercepts shortcuts only while\nthe composer textarea is focused:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"- **Arrow Up/Down** — reads historical user messages from the live\n`ConversationSnapshot` and fills "},{"id":"p21s2","text":"the composer via `inputActions.setDraft()`.\n- **Ctrl+C** — calls `setDraft('')` when the input is no"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"n-empty and nothing is selected."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"No host process code, no persistence, no settings — pure client-side, stops cleanly\non plugin stop/u"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"t process code, no persistence, no settings — pure client-side, stops cleanly\non plugin stop/update."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## 🗂 Project structure"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## 🤝 Contributing"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"PRs are welcome! Please make sure the plugin still works in the DSH Web GUI after\nyour change. Keep "},{"id":"p26s2","text":"the client code plain-JavaScript (no TypeScript/JSX in the shipped\n`lib/` output) and never add host"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"-side logic unless the feature truly needs it."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## 📄 License"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
